<title>UK: London timecharter fixtures.</title>
<headline>London timecharter fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antwerpia - (built 1990) 68,500 dwt 13.5 on 31 del USG 10-15/1 four to six months $11,750 daily plus $300,000 bb if redel Far East Seyang.</p>
<p>Apollonia Lion - (built 1977) 72,044 dwt del USG early Jan trip Egyptian Med $10,250 daily plus $250,000 bb Bluedeck (reported).</p>
<p>Nordbulk - (built 1991) 65,434 dwt 14 on 28 plus one del Yokkaichi prompt trip via eastern Australia redel Japan $10,750 daily.</p>
</text>
